# Cost Optimization

## Mục tiêu

Cost Optimization là quá trình liên tục giám sát, phân tích, và cải thiện việc sử dụng cloud resources để đạt được hiệu quả chi phí tối đa mà không ảnh hưởng đến performance và reliability. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, Cost Optimization rule định nghĩa các nguyên tắc và best practices cho việc quản lý chi phí cloud một cách chủ động, từ architecture design đến day-to-day operations. Mục tiêu là giúp teams reduce costs mà vẫn maintain required service levels.

Cloud costs có thể spiral out of control nếu không được quản lý chủ động. Một application có thể chạy được nhưng với chi phí cao hơn mức cần thiết. Rule này cover cost visibility, resource optimization, pricing models, và governance processes.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Cost Visibility**

Tag all resources for attribution. Cost allocation by team, project, environment. Budget alerts và notifications. Regular cost reviews. Cost dashboards. Trend analysis. Anomaly detection.

**2. Right-Sizing**

Right-size compute resources. Analyze utilization metrics. Scale down over-provisioned. Use burstable instances appropriately. Review regularly. Automate recommendations.

**3. Reserved Capacity**

Purchase reserved instances for steady-state. Convertible vs standard. 1-year vs 3-year terms. Analyze utilization before purchase. Savings plans options. Balance commitment vs flexibility.

**4. Auto-Scaling**

Implement auto-scaling policies. Scale based on metrics. Use predictive scaling. Scale down during low traffic. Avoid scaling thrashing. Test scaling policies.

**5. Resource Scheduling**

Schedule non-production resources. Dev/test environments. Batch processing jobs. Spot/preemptible for fault-tolerant. Scheduled start/stop. Cost allocation.

**6. Storage Optimization**

Choose appropriate storage classes. Lifecycle policies. Delete unused data. Archive old data. Compression. Data transfer costs.

**7. Networking Optimization**

Minimize data transfer. Use VPC endpoints. CDN for static assets. Cache aggressively. Data compression. Regional affinity.

**8. Serverless Efficiency**

Use serverless for variable workloads. Pay per invocation. Optimize function memory. Cold start optimization. Batch invocations. Architecture for cost.

**9. Database Optimization**

Right-size database instances. Connection pooling. Read replicas for read-heavy. Auto-scaling databases. Reserved capacity. Query optimization.

**10. FinOps Practices**

Embed cost in design decisions. Cost-aware architecture. Showback/chargeback. Cost optimization culture. Regular optimization reviews. Engineer accountability.

